## Academic Project Management and Evaluation System

### 1. PROJECT MISSION

Build **AcadFlow, an Academic Project Management and Evaluation System**, as a real, functional, secure, full-stack application for engineering colleges, academic departments, project mentors, students and external evaluators.

The application must provide persistent data storage, secure authentication, exactly four application roles, complete academic project lifecycle workflows, department administration, private document management, notifications, reports, analytics, audit logs, automated tests and deployment documentation.

This is not a static UI prototype, a set of disconnected CRUD pages, a mock dashboard or a fake API.

Prioritize correctness, security, data integrity, maintainability and verified functionality over appearance or speed.

**Technology choice:** No specific language, framework, database or tool is mandated. Before implementation, propose a suitable, maintained, production-ready technology stack and get approval. The chosen stack must support every requirement below.

